### Events
### a. GET /events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### b. GET /events/{event_id}/sections/{section_id}/seats
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/8a90c9fa-f408-4fb5-be05-35b730b8e8fe/sections/5181642d-7f74-42c2-a95f-46ec36855135/seats

### Booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/booking/69f5a274-0c08-4f03-97b2-2e835b63bbc7?userId=fedf21e2-22c1-4a5f-8e84-7a7df4a9a499

### Create a new booking with A1
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "fedf21e2-22c1-4a5f-8e84-7a7df4a9a499",
  "eventId": "8a90c9fa-f408-4fb5-be05-35b730b8e8fe",
  "seatId": "dbb1e491-a77a-419a-b77e-9660317f101b",
  "price": 120.00
}


### Add seat to same booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking/69f5a274-0c08-4f03-97b2-2e835b63bbc7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "fedf21e2-22c1-4a5f-8e84-7a7df4a9a499",
  "eventId": "8a90c9fa-f408-4fb5-be05-35b730b8e8fe",
  "seatId": "157950cf-18e7-40b1-8bda-08bfe3afae0e",
  "price": 120.00
}

### Remove seat from booking
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/booking/69f5a274-0c08-4f03-97b2-2e835b63bbc7/events/8a90c9fa-f408-4fb5-be05-35b730b8e8fe/seats/dbb1e491-a77a-419a-b77e-9660317f101b?userId=fedf21e2-22c1-4a5f-8e84-7a7df4a9a499


### Payments
### a. GET payments/{payment_id} 
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/booking/69f5a274-0c08-4f03-97b2-2e835b63bbc7?userId=fedf21e2-22c1-4a5f-8e84-7a7df4a9a499

### b. Register payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
  "userId": "fedf21e2-22c1-4a5f-8e84-7a7df4a9a499", 
"bookingId": "69f5a274-0c08-4f03-97b2-2e835b63bbc7", 
